you comes down the stair into the hedge.
The Hedge (binary, 8 by 8, seed 3). Find the far gate. Type help for the words.
The Mouth of the Hedge
A stair goes up behind you. A plate is set in the hedge beside it.
East, the way runs one pace and turns left.
> study
Every square opens north or east. Walk north and east and you reach the north-east corner from anywhere. From that corner, one way leads down to every square.
> cast (until (gate?) (if (open? north) (go north) (if (open? east) (go east) (stop))))
The spell holds (chibi). It runs one step a turn; stop ends it.
Ring 1 of the Hedge
North, the way runs one pace and turns right.
West, the way runs one pace to a dead end.
Ring 2 of the Hedge
East, the way runs three paces with openings on the right at one and two and goes on into the dark.
South, the way runs one pace and turns right.
Ring 3 of the Hedge
East, the way runs three paces with an opening on the right at one and forks.
South, the way runs one pace to a dead end.
West, the way runs one pace and turns left.
Ring 4 of the Hedge
East, the way runs two paces and forks.
South, the way runs one pace to a dead end.
West, the way runs two paces with an opening on the left at one and turns left.
Ring 5 of the Hedge
East, the way runs one pace and forks.
West, the way runs three paces with openings on the left at one and two and turns left.
Ring 6 of the Hedge
North, the way runs one pace and turns right.
South, the way runs one pace and turns right.
West, the way runs three paces with openings on the left at two and three and goes on into the dark.
Ring 7 of the Hedge
East, the way runs one pace and forks.
South, the way runs two paces with an opening on the right at one and turns right.
Ring 8 of the Hedge
North, the way runs three paces with openings on the left at one and two and turns right.
South, the way runs two paces to a dead end.
West, the way runs one pace and turns left.
Ring 9 of the Hedge
North, the way runs two paces with an opening on the left at one and turns right.
South, the way runs three paces with an opening on the right at one to a dead end.
West, the way runs one pace to a dead end.
Ring 10 of the Hedge
North, the way runs one pace and turns right.
South, the way runs three paces with openings on the right at one and two and goes on into the dark.
West, the way runs one pace to a dead end.
Ring 11 of the Hedge
East, the way runs one pace and forks.
South, the way runs three paces with openings on the right at one, two and three and goes on into the dark.
Ring 12 of the Hedge
North, the way runs two paces with an opening on the left at one and turns left.
South, the way runs three paces and goes on into the dark.
West, the way runs one pace and turns left.
Ring 13 of the Hedge
North, the way runs one pace and turns left.
South, the way runs three paces with an opening on the right at one and goes on into the dark.
West, the way runs three paces with openings on the left at two and three and goes on into the dark.
Ring 14 of the Hedge
South, the way runs three paces with openings on the right at one and two and goes on into the dark.
West, the way runs three paces and goes on into the dark.
The spell ends.
